     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMRelatedPerson</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-related-entity.html\">CDA - relatedEntityversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedEntity</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.identifier</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Pas de champ id explicite porté par relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">RelatedEntity.relatedPerson référence le profil CDA SÉPARÉ fr-cda-assigned-person ; cf. groupe dédié ci-dessous.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.subject</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Porté implicitement par le contexte : relatedEntity est un sous-élément du patient dans recordTarget.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.relationship</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedEntity.code (Lien de la personne avec le patient/usager.)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.address</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedEntity.addr (Adresse géopostale.)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.telecom</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedEntity.telecom (Coordonnées télécom.)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.gender</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié au sexe de la personne liée dans relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.birthDate</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la date de naissance de la personne liée dans relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.deceased</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié au décès de la personne liée dans relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.multipleBirth</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la naissance multiple de la personne liée dans relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.photo</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la photo de la personne liée dans relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.period</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la période de validité du lien dans relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.communication</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucun champ CDA dédié à la langue de communication de la personne liée dans relatedEntity.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMRelatedPerson</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-assigned-person.html\">CDA - assignedPersonversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Person.name (Identité de la personne physique responsable)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 3 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMHumanName</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-name.html\">CDA - Nameversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHumanName.use</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PN.use (Use Code)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHumanName.family</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PN.item.family (Nom de famille ou nom d’usage)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHumanName.given</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PN.item.given (Prénom)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHumanName.prefix</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PN.item.prefix (Civilité)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHumanName.suffix</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PN.item.suffix (Titre)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMHumanName.period</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>PN.validTime (Valid Time)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 4 </b>Mapping de <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document-core/StructureDefinition/FRLMRelatedPerson</code> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-fhir-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-related-person-document.html\">FR RelatedPerson Documentversion : 0.1.0)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson (A person that is related to a patient, but who is not a direct target of care)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.identifier</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.identifier (A human identifier for this person)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.name (Nom de la personne)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.subject</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.patient (The patient this person is related to)</td><td>RelatedPerson.patient.resolve().ofType(Patient)</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.relationship</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.relationship (The nature of the relationship)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.address</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.address (An address expressed using postal conventions (as opposed to GPS or other location definition formats))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.telecom</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.telecom (Details of a Technology mediated contact point (phone, fax, email, etc.))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.gender</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.gender (male | female | other | unknown)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.birthDate</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>RelatedPerson.birthDate (The date on which the related person was born)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.deceased</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">RelatedPerson R4 ne porte pas nativement d